OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain stalls over parts of the
OL,6,Fwest and north, falling as snow over
OL,7,Fhigh ground, and bringing some heavy
OL,8,Fand persistent downpours particularly
OL,9,Fto parts of Cornwall and
OL,10,FPembrokeshire. Drier and brighter away
OL,11,Ffrom these areas and feeling cold.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain and hill snow continues
OL,14,Fin Scotland, but breaks up elsewhere
OL,15,Fto leave a mostly dry night with some
OL,16,Fclear spells. Winds ease and
OL,17,Ftemperatures fall away quickly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
